      "value": "This has been requested several times since year 2017, and also closed in the past as \"not planned at this time or in the future\".\n\nDuplicate feature request, can be merged with:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/mailbox-messaging-system\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/in-game-messaging-text-and-voice\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/in-game-messaging-and-notification-system\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/private-messages\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/vrchat-needs-direct-messaging-system\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-offline-messagesgeneral-messages\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/messaging-system-5\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/messaging-system-8\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/messaging-system-6\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/messaging-system-7\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/messaging-system-9\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/vrchat-messaging-system\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/better-messaging\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/direct-messaging-between-friends\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/in-game-messaging-system-1\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/messaging-and-social-feature-revamp\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/in-menu-messaging-system\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/short-temporary-messaging-system\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/no-boops-how-about-messaging\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/direct-messages-to-friends-and-groups\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/short-direct-messages-to-friends-only\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/direct-message-system-for-friends-only\n\nTechnically the option to send a private message to a VRChat user exists on VRChat Ask forum, I believe. It's separate from the web API and client, however.",
